# I (2026-11-19): MicoAir MTF-01 (8 m ToF + flow over MAVLink) with the rangefinder as the EKF height source.
# Replaces route B (G_extnav_height.parm) for flights over a flat floor: the companion sends no height
# (companion.yaml mavlink.ext_height: false) and the FC needs no VisualOdom.
# Gates from the SITL study of 2026-11-19 (opt_flow2): a wrong rangefinder reading for 1-3 s then moves the drone
# < 0.04 m; SURFTRAK_MODE 0 keeps LOITER / ALT_HOLD from following the raw rangefinder past the EKF gate.
EK3_SRC1_POSZ    2
EK3_RNG_USE_HGT  -1
VISO_TYPE        0
EK3_RNG_M_NSE    0.1
EK3_HGT_I_GATE   200
SURFTRAK_MODE    0
# Source set 3 = optical flow + barometer height: the companion's height guard (companion/height_guard.py) switches
# to it with MAV_CMD_SET_EKF_SOURCE_SET when the rangefinder and the barometer disagree, then asks for LAND.
EK3_SRC3_POSXY   0
EK3_SRC3_VELXY   5
EK3_SRC3_POSZ    1
EK3_SRC3_VELZ    0
EK3_SRC3_YAW     0
